{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-protocol-design","title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/sync-protocol-design","wordCount":1971,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"同步协议设计\">同步协议设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>同步协议定义了多副本数据如何收敛到一致状态。核心概念包括：同步模型（状态式 vs 操作式）、同步粒度（行/字段/操作）、增量机制（Cursor / Checkpoint）、传输层选择（SSE/WebSocket/HTTP/3）、幂等性保证（操作 ID 去重）、因果一致性（向量时钟 / HLC），以及批量策略与流量控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步协议的本质-分布式状态收敛\">同步协议的本质：分布式状态收敛</h2><p>同步协议解决的核心问题是：当多个设备各自持有数据的本地副本并独立修改后，如何让所有副本最终收敛到一致状态。这本质上是分布式系统中的状态复制问题，但移动端增加了独特约束——间歇性连接、有限带宽、电池敏感、设备间时钟不同步。</p>\n<p>一个完整的同步协议需要回答五个设计问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同步单元</strong>：以什么粒度同步（行/文档/字段/操作）</li>\n<li><strong>变更表示</strong>：用什么格式描述变更（状态快照 vs 操作序列）</li>\n<li><strong>传输模式</strong>：推送（Push）还是拉取（Pull）还是双向流（Bidirectional Stream）</li>\n<li><strong>排序保证</strong>：因果序（Causal Order）还是全序（Total Order）</li>\n<li><strong>收敛策略</strong>：冲突时如何合并（LWW / 合并函数 / CRDT）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"两种基本同步模型\">两种基本同步模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;状态式同步 (State-based)&quot;&#10;        S1[Client A 状态] --&gt;|全量/增量快照| SERVER_S[Server]&#10;        SERVER_S --&gt;|合并后状态| S2[Client B]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;操作式同步 (Operation-based)&quot;&#10;        O1[Client A 操作日志] --&gt;|操作序列| SERVER_O[Server]&#10;        SERVER_O --&gt;|转发操作| O2[Client B]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"状态式同步 (State-based)\"\n        S1[Client A 状态] --&gt;|全量/增量快照| SERVER_S[Server]\n        SERVER_S --&gt;|合并后状态| S2[Client B]\n    end\n    subgraph \"操作式同步 (Operation-based)\"\n        O1[Client A 操作日志] --&gt;|操作序列| SERVER_O[Server]\n        SERVER_O --&gt;|转发操作| O2[Client B]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>状态式（State-based）</th>\n<th>操作式（Operation-based）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输内容</td>\n<td>当前完整状态或 diff</td>\n<td>操作序列（insert/update/delete）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽效率</td>\n<td>状态大时浪费带宽</td>\n<td>只传 delta，带宽高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等性</td>\n<td>天然幂等（相同状态合并多次结果一样）</td>\n<td>需要额外保证（操作重放风险）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>简单，但 diff 计算可能昂贵</td>\n<td>复杂，需维护操作顺序和因果关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突处理</td>\n<td>基于最终状态比较</td>\n<td>基于操作意图理解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>CloudKit、Firebase RTDB</td>\n<td>Replicache、EventSourcing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>移动端实践选择</strong>：大多数移动应用采用<strong>混合模型</strong>——首次同步用状态式（全量拉取），后续增量同步用操作式（只传变更）。PowerSync 和 ElectricSQL 都采用这种混合策略：初始同步流式拉取 shape/snapshot，后续通过 WAL streaming 增量推送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步粒度选择\">同步粒度选择</h2><p>同步粒度直接影响冲突概率和带宽消耗：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>conflict</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>granularity</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>concurrent writers</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{conflict}) \\propto \\frac{1}{\\text{granularity}} \\times N_{\\text{concurrent writers}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conflict</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">granularity</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">concurrent writers</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>粒度越细，同一单元被并发修改的概率越低，但元数据开销越大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>冲突概率</th>\n<th>元数据开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整表</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>配置/偏好（单用户）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行/文档</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大多数 CRUD 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段/属性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>表单类数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符/操作</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>协作文本编辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CloudKit 默认以记录（Record）为粒度做 LWW，SwiftData 同步在 iOS 19 中支持字段级 LWW。PowerSync 以行为粒度，ElectricSQL 同样以行为粒度通过 Postgres logical replication 流式传输。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量同步协议-cursor-与-checkpoint\">增量同步协议：Cursor 与 Checkpoint</h2><p>增量同步的关键是客户端和服务端对「从哪里继续」达成共识。两种主流机制：</p>\n<p><strong>Cursor（游标）模式</strong>：客户端持有一个递增的版本号或时间戳，每次同步时告诉服务端「给我 cursor 之后的所有变更」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Client → Server: GET /sync?since=cursor_42&amp;limit=100&#10;Server → Client: {changes: [...], next_cursor: cursor_57, has_more: true}&#10;Client: 应用 changes → 更新本地 cursor = cursor_57 → 继续拉取\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Client → Server: GET /sync?since=cursor_42&#x26;limit=100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Server → Client: {changes: [...], next_cursor: cursor_57, has_more: true}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Client: 应用 changes → 更新本地 cursor = cursor_57 → 继续拉取</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Checkpoint（检查点）模式</strong>：服务端维护全局递增的 checkpoint ID，客户端持有最后同步的 checkpoint。适用于服务端能保证变更全序的场景。</p>\n<p>设计选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cursor 适合客户端主动拉取（Pull）模式</li>\n<li>Checkpoint 适合服务端推送（Push）或流式订阅模式</li>\n<li>两者都需要处理 cursor/checkpoint 过期的情况（服务端 GC 了历史变更）——回退到全量重同步</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"传输层设计\">传输层设计</h2><p>移动端同步的传输层需要适应网络的不稳定性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[同步引擎] --&gt; B{当前网络状态}&#10;    B --&gt;|稳定连接| C[WebSocket / SSE 流式推送]&#10;    B --&gt;|间歇性| D[HTTP 批量拉取]&#10;    B --&gt;|恢复连接| E[Catch-up:批量拉取 + 切换到流式]&#10;    C --&gt; F[实时变更推送]&#10;    D --&gt; G[定时轮询或事件触发]&#10;    E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[同步引擎] --&gt; B{当前网络状态}\n    B --&gt;|稳定连接| C[WebSocket / SSE 流式推送]\n    B --&gt;|间歇性| D[HTTP 批量拉取]\n    B --&gt;|恢复连接| E[Catch-up:批量拉取 + 切换到流式]\n    C --&gt; F[实时变更推送]\n    D --&gt; G[定时轮询或事件触发]\n    E --&gt; F</pre><p><strong>协议选择矩阵</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>带宽效率</th>\n<th>断线恢复</th>\n<th>移动端友好度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP 轮询</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n<td>低（每次连接开销）</td>\n<td>无状态，天然支持</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 长轮询</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超时重连</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSE (Server-Sent Events)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（单向流）</td>\n<td>自带 <code>Last-Event-ID</code> 恢复</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高（双向流）</td>\n<td>需手动实现重连和恢复</td>\n<td>中（keepalive 问题）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/3 (QUIC)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>连接迁移（IP 切换不中断）</td>\n<td>高（2026 年移动端原生支持）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的趋势是 <strong>SSE + HTTP/3</strong>：SSE 提供服务端推送能力且协议简单、自带恢复机制；HTTP/3 的 QUIC 传输层天然适应移动端频繁的网络切换。ElectricSQL 和 PowerSync 都采用 HTTP streaming（本质是 SSE 变种）作为主要推送机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等性与恰好一次语义\">幂等性与恰好一次语义</h2><p>网络不稳定导致同步请求可能被重复发送。协议必须保证幂等性——同一操作执行多次的效果与执行一次相同：</p>\n<p>实现幂等性的常见手段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>客户端生成唯一操作 ID</strong>：每次写入分配 UUID，服务端去重</li>\n<li><strong>版本向量/逻辑时钟</strong>：通过版本号判断操作是否已被应用</li>\n<li><strong>CRDT 的数学保证</strong>：合并操作天然幂等（合并 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次与合并 1 次结果相同）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>服务端去重表设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE sync_operations (&#10;    operation_id  TEXT PRIMARY KEY,  -- 客户端生成的 UUID&#10;    client_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    applied_at    TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    -- TTL：30 天后可清理（客户端不可能重发 30 天前的操作）&#10;    expires_at    TIMESTAMP&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sync_operations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    operation_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 客户端生成的 UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    client_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    applied_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- TTL：30 天后可清理（客户端不可能重发 30 天前的操作）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expires_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"因果一致性与向量时钟\">因果一致性与向量时钟</h2><p>在多设备场景中，操作之间存在因果关系：「用户在设备 A 上创建任务 → 在设备 B 上编辑该任务」。同步协议必须保证因果序——设备 B 不能在未收到「创建」操作时就应用「编辑」操作。</p>\n<p>向量时钟（Vector Clock）是保证因果一致性的经典机制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>节点 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext> 已知的节点 </mtext><mi>j</mi><mtext> 的最新逻辑时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VC_i[j] = \\text{节点 } i \\text{ 已知的节点 } j \\text{ 的最新逻辑时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节点</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已知的节点</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的最新逻辑时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>比较规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VC_a &lt; VC_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 因果先于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall k: VC_a[k] \\leq VC_b[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists k: VC_a[k] &lt; VC_b[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VC_a \\| VC_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 并发）：既非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a &lt; b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 也非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b &lt; a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>移动端简化：当设备数量有限（通常 &lt; 10）时，向量时钟的空间开销可接受。设备数量大时可采用 Dotted Version Vectors 或 Hybrid Logical Clocks（HLC）。</p>\n<p>HLC 结合了物理时钟和逻辑时钟的优势：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HLC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>physical_time</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>logical_counter</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>node_id</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HLC} = (\\text{physical\\_time}, \\text{logical\\_counter}, \\text{node\\_id})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HLC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">physical_time</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">logical_counter</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">node_id</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它在 NTP 同步良好时接近物理时间，在时钟回拨或冲突时退化为逻辑时钟，是 2026 年多数同步引擎的默认时间戳方案。<a href=\"conflict-resolution-strategies\">冲突解决策略</a> 中会详细讨论如何基于 HLC 实现字段级 LWW。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量同步与流量控制\">批量同步与流量控制</h2><p>移动端同步的批量策略直接影响用户体验与资源消耗的平衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>资源效率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立即推送</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最差（频繁唤醒网络栈）</td>\n<td>聊天消息等实时性要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微批次（1-5s）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>大多数协作应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时批量（30s-5min）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>后台同步、非实时数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件触发</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>Wi-Fi + 充电时同步大数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产环境通常组合使用：关键数据（用户明确操作产生的变更）走微批次或立即推送，非关键数据（日志、分析、预缓存）走条件触发。WorkManager 在 Android 上、<code>BGProcessingTask</code> 在 iOS 上提供了条件触发的系统级支持。</p>\n<p>完整的流量控制还需要考虑服务端的背压（Backpressure）——当客户端积压了大量离线变更时，不能一次性洪泛服务端，需要分批上传并监控服务端响应时间。具体实现参见 <a href=\"../operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization\">带宽与电量优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>同步协议设计是离线同步系统的骨架——它决定了数据以什么粒度、什么格式、什么顺序在设备间流动。状态式与操作式模型各有取舍，实践中多采用混合方案。增量同步通过 cursor/checkpoint 实现带宽高效的持续同步，HLC 解决移动端时钟不可信的排序问题，幂等性保证网络重试的安全性。传输层的选择则直接影响实时性与移动端资源消耗的平衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同步协议设计","id":"同步协议设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"同步协议的本质：分布式状态收敛","id":"同步协议的本质-分布式状态收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"两种基本同步模型","id":"两种基本同步模型"},{"level":2,"text":"同步粒度选择","id":"同步粒度选择"},{"level":2,"text":"增量同步协议：Cursor 与 Checkpoint","id":"增量同步协议-cursor-与-checkpoint"},{"level":2,"text":"传输层设计","id":"传输层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等性与恰好一次语义","id":"幂等性与恰好一次语义"},{"level":2,"text":"因果一致性与向量时钟","id":"因果一致性与向量时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"批量同步与流量控制","id":"批量同步与流量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络状态检测与切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/network-state-detection"},"next":{"title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies"}}